ggg6KfcPQZG_title_-2124750075","default":"Image Title"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSCJ043XWG_text_-637051751","label":"ggSCJ043XWG_text_-637051751","default":"December 7, 2023"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8T8dJb2Z6_text_311078194","label":"gg8T8dJb2Z6_text_311078194","default":"<span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Elevating the Health of&nbsp;</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Your Senior Dog</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggciEcfm229_text_-1969963852","label":"ggciEcfm229_text_-1969963852","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:15px;\">Did you know that Smack Pet Food is a versatile choice that can cater to every stage of your furry friend's life? Our raw dehydrated superfood product offers the ideal blend of raw, fresh nutrition in a convenient, no-fuss format—no fridge or freezer required! In this blog, we're excited to shed light on how transitioning your senior dog to a Smack-exclusive diet can make a remarkable difference in their well-being and quality of life.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUjN1dR4FK_label_1474786502","label":"ggUjN1dR4FK_label_1474786502","default":"Read More"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVwVZiFU_H_srcSet_desktop_src_-555133884","label":"ggVwVZiFU_H_srcSet_desktop_src_-555133884","default":"https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVwVZiFU_H_alt_1978768214","label":"ggVwVZiFU_H_alt_1978768214","default":"Alt Image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVwVZiFU_H_title_-2124750075","label":"ggVwVZiFU_H_title_-2124750075","default":"Image Title"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdSOQnoOm4_text_-502296209","label":"ggdSOQnoOm4_text_-502296209","default":"November 14,2023"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqADxiD5lw_text_99754950","label":"ggqADxiD5lw_text_99754950","default":"The Benefits of (Curly) Parsley"},{"type":"html","id":"gguGOdGH1R3_text_-694066912","label":"gguGOdGH1R3_text_-694066912","default":"<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.6667px;\">Parsley - probably not the first ingredient we think of when it comes to superfoods, but this herb has more to offer than just a pop of green on your plate. Parsley - the curly variety - actually offers a range of AMAZING nutritional benefits to our pets (and us!). A powerhouse of vitamins as well as anti-inflammatory and antioxidant properties, we’re all about including it in our pets’ bowls. Read on for more about why parsley really is a paw-some herb</span><br>&nbsp;"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtq9gYAZ4C_label_1474786502","label":"ggtq9gYAZ4C_label_1474786502","default":"Read More"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSKJEx0C9Y_srcSet_desktop_src_-555133884","label":"ggSKJEx0C9Y_srcSet_desktop_src_-555133884","default":"https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSKJEx0C9Y_alt_1978768214","label":"ggSKJEx0C9Y_alt_1978768214","default":"Alt Image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSKJEx0C9Y_title_-2124750075","label":"ggSKJEx0C9Y_title_-2124750075","default":"Image Title"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWYZkL69BL_text_1860969097","label":"ggWYZkL69BL_text_1860969097","default":"October 30, 2023"},{"type":"html","id":"gglaSKJYXUb_text_1587376970","label":"gglaSKJYXUb_text_1587376970","default":"Animal Pain Awareness"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1YsjY8v4G_text_-1891948880","label":"gg1YsjY8v4G_text_-1891948880","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:15px;\">One often-overlooked aspect crucial for the well-being of our pets is recognizing the signs of pain they exhibit. Equally significant is our knowledge of how to maintain their overall health through a proper diet, which aids in preserving robust joint health and alleviating discomfort for our beloved companions. In this blog, we delve into the topic of animal pain awareness and offer expert insights from Belinda Morrison, the founder of CB Rescue, a non-profit dog rescue organization in Calgary, Alberta.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHHzh_1YGL_label_1474786502","label":"ggHHzh_1YGL_label_1474786502","default":"Read More"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDeTeoAYL-_srcSet_desktop_src_-555133884","label":"ggDeTeoAYL-_srcSet_desktop_src_-555133884","default":"https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDeTeoAYL-_alt_1978768214","label":"ggDeTeoAYL-_alt_1978768214","default":"Alt Image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDeTeoAYL-_title_-2124750075","label":"ggDeTeoAYL-_title_-2124750075","default":"Image Title"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDXLQsMld3_text_1084757635","label":"ggDXLQsMld3_text_1084757635","default":"October 4, 2023"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfPUsPfKRa_text_30260774","label":"ggfPUsPfKRa_text_30260774","default":"The Benefits of Pumpkin"},{"type":"html","id":"gguVvTphE3n_text_-2106492649","label":"gguVvTphE3n_text_-2106492649","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:15px;\">’Tis the pumpkin season! Pumpkin pie, pumpkin spice lattes, pumpkin bread - it’s hard to avoid this Thanksgiving favourite. But did you ever wonder if your pet was missing out by not getting to join in on this taste of fall? Perhaps surprisingly, pumpkin is an amazing ingredient to include in your dog or cat’s diet, and offers a huge range of benefits to their short and long-term health. Read on for more about what makes pumpkin so perfect!</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggABSY1VIug_label_1474786502","label":"ggABSY1VIug_label_1474786502","default":"Read More"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXG42J5kAe_srcSet_desktop_src_-555133884","label":"ggXG42J5kAe_srcSet_desktop_src_-555133884","default":"https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXG42J5kAe_alt_1978768214","label":"ggXG42J5kAe_alt_1978768214","default":"Alt Image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXG42J5kAe_title_-2124750075","label":"ggXG42J5kAe_title_-2124750075","de