r the management of Tracy Dow. Explore their commitment to Canadian-made pet products, nutrient-dense options like Smack Pet Foods, and the mission to offer value and quality to loyal customers in the Greater Victoria area.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5-M2-dgna_label_1474786502","label":"gg5-M2-dgna_label_1474786502","default":"Read More"},{"type":"html","id":"ggayvTpBCX0_srcSet_desktop_src_-555133884","label":"ggayvTpBCX0_srcSet_desktop_src_-555133884","default":"https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/"},{"type":"html","id":"ggayvTpBCX0_alt_1978768214","label":"ggayvTpBCX0_alt_1978768214","default":"Alt Image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggayvTpBCX0_title_-2124750075","label":"ggayvTpBCX0_title_-2124750075","default":"Image Title"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCdBzaywm4_text_722672888","label":"ggCdBzaywm4_text_722672888","default":"September 7, 2023"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx5QJKZghN_text_311078194","label":"ggx5QJKZghN_text_311078194","default":"<span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Elevating the Health of&nbsp;</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Your Senior Dog</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghGbv-SFOU_text_-2049004257","label":"gghGbv-SFOU_text_-2049004257","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:15px;\">We understand that leaving your beloved pet alone at home can be a daunting task. Whether you are returning to the office after years of remote work or the kids are heading back to school after a summer of play, your pet will likely need some support as they adapt to solitude. Discover how to smooth this transition and understand the emotional cues your pet may convey during your absence.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTiybxBFzw_label_1474786502","label":"ggTiybxBFzw_label_1474786502","default":"Read More"}],
